    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice Pulling Focus In this free simulator! designed to help you gain a better Idea and appreciation for 1st ACs and one of the many jobs they have on set<br><br> The features included are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > your choice of 9 Prime lenses Loosely Based off the Arri Master Primes, And 2 Zoom lenses, Loosely based of the Fujinon 19 -90 And the\u00a0Angenieux 45 - 120.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T stop from T 1.2 to 11 adjustable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable Film Grain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable Chromatic Aberration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus Peaking\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many scenarios for Fallowing Peoples movements, to keeping up with erratic operators as they get B-roll.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features to follow A persons as they do common movements.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More In Development!\u00a0<br><br><br>Playable with a mouse wheel OR a DIY interface that's compatible with your hand unit. The DIY Interface project files will be available when the game launches into early access.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice Pulling Focus In this free simulator! designed to help you gain a better Idea and appreciation for 1st ACs and one of the many jobs they have on set<br><br> The features included are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > your choice of 9 Prime lenses Loosely Based off the Arri Master Primes, And 2 Zoom lenses, Loosely based of the Fujinon 19 -90 And the\u00a0Angenieux 45 - 120.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T stop from T 1.2 to 11 adjustable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable Film Grain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable Chromatic Aberration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus Peaking\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many scenarios for Fallowing Peoples movements, to keeping up with erratic operators as they get B-roll.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features to follow A persons as they do common movements.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More In Development!\u00a0<br><br><br>Playable with a mouse wheel OR a DIY interface that's compatible with your hand unit. The DIY Interface project files will be available when the game launches into early access.</p></li></ul>",
